// The first of the three affixes that charge for what they grant, and the
// shape all three take: a stat on the slot no clean affix will put it on,
// paid for on that slot's own axis.
//
// Nothing else grants ATK on armour. That is what keeps a drawback worth
// rolling against a calibration ceiling of +3 — an affix that merely
// undercut Hardened would be strictly worse than Hardened and no player
// would ever want it, however common it was.
(
    id: "volatile",
    prefix: Some("Volatile"),
    stats: (atk: 2, mitigation: -3),
    slots: Some([Armor]),
    weight: 6,
)
